 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Get an adjustable stand. They' cheap and you can adjust the height with one hand while you wear gloves. Yes, they' small enough to fit in a bag. A simple tripod can also be set up in minutes, and you can use both hands to adjust it. Not really. Even laptops get tired of being balanced on something all day. A proper stand gives better support. A keyboard mat that rolls on the desk keeps keyboards from falling off. Try finding a right handed trackpad for left hands. They usually feel better.",
